@prefix ex: <http://example.org/> .
@prefix sh: <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#> .

# 999 nested sh:zeroOrMorePath links -> depth exactly 1000. The comparison is
# (> depth budget), so this is the off-by-one guard on the boundary: it must
# still validate. Post-fix it is also the strongest statement that the memo is
# exact rather than merely small.

